<title>JAPAN: NCB 96/97 stock appraisal loss at 117.37 bln yen.</title>
<headline>NCB 96/97 stock appraisal loss at 117.37 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd (NCB) said on Friday that its appraisal loss from securities holdings totalled 117.37 billion yen at the end of its last business year to March 31, 1997.</p>
